  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hab 102.09 “Document” means any written material filed with the board, including all appeals, petitions, motions, letters, and memoranda excluding exhibits submitted at a hearing.\n\nSource. #13226 eff 7-7-21",
